        "answer": {
          "short": "$5985$\n\nSubtract the sum from 1 to 50 from the sum from 1 to 120.",
          "worked": "Subtract the sum from 1 to 50 from the sum from 1 to 120.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}S_{120}&=\\frac{120\\times121}{2}\\\\S_{120}&=7260\\\\S_{50}&=\\frac{50\\times51}{2}\\\\S_{50}&=1275\\\\S_{51\\text{ to }120}&=7260-1275\\\\S_{51\\text{ to }120}&=5985\\end{align*}$$",
